graph LR
    COMMIT[Git Commit Push] --> S1[Secret Scanning: TruffleHog]
    S1 --> S2[SAST Code Scan: Semgrep]
    S2 --> S3[Dependency Audit: npm / pip-audit]
    S3 --> S4[Container CVE Scan: Trivy]
